// Who this build is signed by, and what it is called.
//
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  NOTE FOR JAKE — you should not have to touch this file.
//
//  The defaults below are exactly what the project always used: your team
//  (KDM65HE483) and com.jakebeinart.settlers. Pull, build, run — nothing
//  changes for you.
//
//  It exists because a second developer cannot sign with your team, and the
//  old fix was to edit project.yml directly, which would have arrived in
//  your PRs as a change to your signing setup. Instead, anyone who needs a
//  different team drops a `Signing.local.xcconfig` next to this file and it
//  overrides the two values. That file is gitignored, so it never reaches
//  you and never appears in a diff.
//
//  If you ever DO need to change your own team or bundle id, change it here
//  and it applies to everyone who has not overridden it.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

SETTLERS_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = KDM65HE483
SETTLERS_BUNDLE_ID = com.jakebeinart.settlers

// Optional, and deliberately last: assignments in an included file win over
// the ones above it. The `?` means "include it if it exists" - a normal
// `#include` of a missing file is a hard build error, which would break the
// build for everyone who has not created one.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
